<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear
<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[BPL Name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">**Add
personal introduction**</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">I hope this email finds you well. Unfortunately,
we are currently facing a significant shortfall in sign-ups, and need to take
immediate action to increase appointments to ensure the success of upcoming
drives.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Meeting your blood drive goal is critically
important because patients are counting on the blood we have committed to
collect.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Given our contingency recruitment plan, let’s
discuss what is and isn’t working. With your help and the support of our
community, we can encourage more people to come forward and donate.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Here are some strategies we can implement
together to increase donor participation:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<ol style="margin-top:0in" start="1" type="1">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
     &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Leverage the power of
     social media to spread the word.</span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
     font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"> Infographics,
     videos and stories of how blood donations have saved lives can be
     emotionally compelling and serve as a motivating factor for others to
     participate. Encourage your friends, family and followers to share posts
     to reach a wider audience.</span>&nbsp;</li></ol>

<ol style="margin-top:0in" start="2" type="1">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
     &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Reach out to local
     businesses, schools and organizations to form partnerships.</span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     Arial"> Collaborating with community partners extends the reach of our
     message and attracts potential donors from different walks of life.<b> </b>Organize
     community events to create awareness and build excitement for upcoming
     drives. And make sure to promote current donor incentives to get donors in
     the door!</span>&nbsp;</li></ol>

<ol style="margin-top:0in" start="3" type="1">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
     &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Encourage volunteers and
     staff to personally invite their friends and colleagues to participate in
     the blood drive.</span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"> A direct invitation can have a powerful
     impact on someone's decision to donate.</span>&nbsp;</li></ol>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">I genuinely believe that by working together and
implementing these strategies, we can turn the tide and ensure a successful
blood drive. Your support in spreading the word and encouraging others to
donate is crucial.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">If you have any other ideas or suggestions,
please don't hesitate to share them. Let's rally our community and help boost
appointments to save lives.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial">Thank you for your time and dedication to this
cause. We are deeply grateful for your involvement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1">Best regards,</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Name]<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Title]<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Email]</span></p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
